    {
        "text": "2:10 P.M. \\ Clear"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde, Leithanien. Once a bustling hub of commerce, this nomadic town is now rarely seen by outsiders."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Rathaus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz Severin Hawthorn, where have you been?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are we supposed to get anything done in a strategic planning session without you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Was I here when you decided my son's fate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... Tatjana should already have...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, she told me. You had her tell me. I'm only reminding you what you've done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the situation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected are still protesting. They've even started chasing off Infected newcomers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do they want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They... they believe the fire was part of some kind of plot. They demand an explanation for Dr. Atro and the dead Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A plot? An explanation? Great, someone must be riling them up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even the Infected wouldn't stoop that low. Most of them are from Wolumonde.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have they had any contact with that militant group out there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "None, for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the militants have been lingering around the outskirts of the hamlet. I'm worried they might influence the protestors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a second, it's from the sentry\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two? Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "They claim to be from Rhodes Island? I know that name\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That would be Dr. Atro's company. *Sigh.* We knew this was coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Atro was a respectable Infected. They may be here looking for her. And they have a right to know the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let them in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "...You heard him. Do as he says.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, are you sure about this? What if they have something to do with the militants out there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Between the Great Rift, the fire, and the Infected, do we have the luxury to be suspicious of everyone who knocks on our door?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about after they learn the truth? What if Rhodes Island seeks reparations from us? How much is Wolumonde to suffer?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So what should we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lock our doors and send them away? Lie to them? Tell them Dr. Atro took some Oripathy patients out on a hike?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know we can't sweep it under the rug. But you don't have the final say in this. We have to prepare for the worst.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one has the final say on the truth, but... Never mind. Do as you will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm leaving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Leaving? Where are you going this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I have a problem to solve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "My only job is to get this town back on track. The decision-making process? I have little patience for your political games.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Wait!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're suffering, and there's so much we could've done better, but we had no choice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. That's why I'm still talking to you nice and peacefully.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll leave Rhodes Island to you. You're good at these things. I'll walk the blocks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Severin! Severin Hawthorn! You are this town's Schultz! You can't be running all over the\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh! Must he always...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it. Tatjana, Severin, Thor. They're all tragic figures, really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get this place cleaned up. Rhodes Island will be here soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
