    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac11_2",
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": 0,
        "yFrom": 20,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": -10,
        "xScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 0.9,
        "yScaleTo": 0.9,
        "duration": 30,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde. Its name means 'The Eighth Moon,' and together with seven other nearby towns, it makes up Leithanien's flourishing northern trade network\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what the book said, anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "From what I'm seeing, 'flourishing trade' isn't exactly how I'd describe it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it be because of the 'Great Rift' thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. A Catastrophe of that scale is rare. It could be more than a thousand meters deep, with exposed active Originium on the cliffsides. I shudder just thinking about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Miss Folinic... You were very curious what would happen if you lobbed a shell into it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nay, that was just my academic curiosity speaking. Realistically, one wrong move and the entire plateau could get cleaved in half.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering the detour we had to take, looks like this town won't be moving an inch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltstreet1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Visitors at a time like this? And such strange clothes. I hope this isn't an ill omen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at her tails. Oh, and the crystals on her shoulder! Is she Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "But those clothes look familiar... Where have I seen them before...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Miss Folinic, can we really just walk down the street like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The prevalence of Originium Arts in Leithanien have brought two major benefits: first, the incredible music scene, and second, a broad tolerance of the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "There may be restrictions on your personal freedom, but should you want to live, you can win back that right as long as you're willing to pay the price.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Price?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "At least it's something affordable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde may be in the boonies and have its fair share of problems, but at least the Infected have a place to live... That's what she told me anyway\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Oh, someone's coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hm? That man's uniform...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Is he with the Wolumonde Gendarmerie? Should we ask for directions?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(He's coming toward us. Is this the welcoming committee?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'm not sure...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh, he lit a cigarette.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He put his lighter into his pocket. Now he's holding the cigarette with his other hand. He switched hands again\u2014)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "(\u2014He walked away without looking back! Miss Folinic!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, we're\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Rhodes Island, I take it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rathaus is just up ahead, right in front of the tallest tower. You see it? Good. Someone will meet you there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, thanks. Can I ask your name...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me? I'm off duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm off duty. And I really don't want to talk so much when I'm off... I have my own business to deal with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the deal. Later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And he's gone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He was kind of rude, but I think he's been through a lot...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah... as if we're not tired!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least he told us where to go. Let's go talk to the local\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz! There you are!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected are protesting again. The Gendarmerie are already on the scene, but they need you there leading them\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! You're smoking! Did the shopkeepers get to you again? Please, you have an image to maintain. You wouldn't want to lose the trust of the people\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's a... Schultz? A 'Schulthei\u00df' is like a local leader?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is something wrong, Schultz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. You're always working so hard, Tatjana. I admire you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you? Thank you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, about those two, they're not from around here, are they? Could they be the doctors from Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Well, yes. We are indeed. I am Folinic and this is Suzuran.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Doctors?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(I think we count.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Even me?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'm a fully-fledged operator assigned to the Medical Department. And Lisa, you've... studied with Dr. Kal'tsit, so we can call you a medical intern. I guess.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see... Oh! You two must be on your way to the Rathaus? I'm so sorry to get in your way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course it should be the Schultz who receives you, but he really is needed at Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse... Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, really, he can\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem! Very good, Tatjana, you take them. I'll go look into this Infected situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know why you're here. But our situation is dire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what happened to Wolumonde?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Rift.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I get to skip over so much when dealing with smart people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "So now the Infected are more riled up than ever before. If you don't want to get mixed up in that, stay away from Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We are experts at dealing with the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. We had a Dr. Atro from your company working closely with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So you know we can help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't need it yet. It wouldn't be right to drag our guests into this mess as soon as they've arrived. That would get us into trouble too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...So what is Atro doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not here right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So where is she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "She...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no! Fighting has broken out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-those Infected have weapons! What's going on?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've got blades! Are they going to kill us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$frontline_intro",
        "key": "$frontline_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "You two are Infected experts, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
